{"id":"n25392-1-8","stage":4,"title":"공군 · 空军","scene":"制度与公共事务","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25392-1-8-1","ko":"공군에 들어가니까 어때?","zh":"加入空军感觉怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"공군에","meaning":"空军","explanation":"공군：空军；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"공군","audio":"/audio/20eb16eaf23ce6e55781.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25392","senseId":"1","lemma":"공군","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공군에","audio":"/audio/dec06cbb884c9679d35c.mp3"}},{"text":"들어가니까","meaning":"加入，进入","explanation":"들어가다：加入，进入；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"들어가다","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67877","senseId":"8","lemma":"들어가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어가니까","audio":"/audio/de79a4091532d665618e.mp3"}},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어때","audio":"/audio/b8638c1eedbc8ab7e09d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"20eb16eaf23ce6e5","term":"공군","zh":"空军","audio":"/audio/20eb16eaf23ce6e55781.mp3","entryId":"25392","definition":"装备各种军用飞机的、担负国土防空的军队。","pronunciation":["공군"]},{"id":"5a3b0d8b05ae781d","term":"들어가다","zh":"加入，进入","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3","entryId":"67877","definition":"成为某团体的一员。","pronunciation":["드러가다"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/2d7e959e742d5fded20e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n25392-1-8-2","ko":"비행기도 타 보고 좋아.","zh":"还能坐飞机，真不错。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"비행기도","meaning":"飞机","explanation":"비행기：飞机；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"비행기","audio":"/audio/3cb2c44c3b680b229e91.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15679","senseId":"1","lemma":"비행기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비행기도","audio":"/audio/92e10fd3b63f0a2d0a5a.mp3"}},{"text":"타","meaning":"乘，乘坐","explanation":"타다：乘，乘坐；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17160","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"타","audio":"/audio/7e40449e6f383f05b54a.mp3"}},{"text":"보고","meaning":"做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보고","audio":"/audio/ddf2aaf35f3c5a087464.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아.","meaning":"好，高兴，愉快","explanation":"좋다：好，高兴，愉快；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"11","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아","audio":"/audio/03b87f7121c91d1c28e1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3cb2c44c3b680b22","term":"비행기","zh":"飞机","audio":"/audio/3cb2c44c3b680b229e91.mp3","entryId":"15679","definition":"载着人或东西在空中飞行的交通工具。","pronunciation":["비행기"]},{"id":"8f835109fdc29a59","term":"타다","zh":"乘，乘坐","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3","entryId":"17160","definition":"坐到交通工具或当作交通工具的动物背上。","pronunciation":["타다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，高兴，愉快","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"感情等很愉悦、很满足。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/5ac72341a0ea5d319666.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.234,"source":{"url":"https://kr